Z||000000||Lewis||07-20-2000||09:57 PM||||I was washing my car and decided to rinse off the engine.  I do this about once every two months and have been doing it for sometime with no problems.  This time everything seemed alright but when I started the car and  turned on the radio I get static.  All the grounds seem to be okay.  Today I was driving and went to pass someone and the tach and oil pressure guage started bouncing around.  When I slowed under sixty it did not happen at all.  No check engine warning.  On my way home I tried it again and when I got over sixty the guages acted up and the car sputtered until I dropped below sixty.  Not sure what is going on so thought maybe someone might have had the same problem...any suggestions would be appreciated...||||reg||1
